      "side": 1,
      "message": "This command was added to support a DFM vendor\u0027s requirements for manufacturing testing. The vendor\u0027s testing tool runs on the host and requires in-band access to the BMC\u0027s I2C bus.\nA similar command already exists in phosphor-host-ipmid, but the standard IPMI specification only allocates 3 bits for the bus number, which is insufficient for most use cases. This new command was introduced to address that limitation.\nRelated discussion on discord: https://discord.com/channels/986224305987784725/986252729410273290/1506909622316040344",
